1
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:07,250
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

2
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:11,860
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

3
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:16,120
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

4
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:20,330
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

5
00:00:20,670 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

6
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:24,730
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

7
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,880
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

8
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:28,760
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

9
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,650
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

10
00:00:30,930 --> 00:00:33,320
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

11
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:35,800
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

12
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:40,560
♪Come, share a cup with me♪

13
00:00:40,570 --> 00:00:42,540
(Welcome to Cold Palace Refreshments)

14
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,040
=Farm Busily in the Cold Palace=

15
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,620
(Based on Hongshu.com's novel
I'm Busy Farming in the Cold Palace)

16
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:49,650
=Episode 17=

17
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:52,680
(The Washing Away of Wrongs)

18
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:00,880
Whenever major matters arose at court,

19
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:03,039
Chancellor Lu and you two were there.

20
00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:05,400
I had only to sit upon my throne.

21
00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:06,799
But now,

22
00:01:07,439 --> 00:01:09,599
one of those three offices lies empty.

23
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:11,879
The three powers stand in balance.

24
00:01:12,439 --> 00:01:13,680
If you cut one off...

25
00:01:14,840 --> 00:01:18,079
So Chancellor Lu was truly framed?

26
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:21,000
I've said it all along!

27
00:01:21,159 --> 00:01:24,760
The old fool escorted relief funds
himself,

28
00:01:24,760 --> 00:01:27,159
lest anyone steal a single coin.

29
00:01:27,920 --> 00:01:29,760
How could he betray our country?

30
00:01:31,480 --> 00:01:33,239
Bai Zhenhai and the Empress Dowager...

31
00:01:33,239 --> 00:01:34,560
One holds the Tiger Military Tally,

32
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:36,120
the other, the court.

33
00:01:36,519 --> 00:01:38,599
Their coordination is flawless.

34
00:01:39,359 --> 00:01:40,560
They mean to leave me

35
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:44,480
utterly alone upon this throne.

36
00:01:46,239 --> 00:01:47,640
Even now, the Empress Dowager

37
00:01:47,959 --> 00:01:49,280
refuses to relinquish power?

38
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:51,439
I thought she merely craved authority.

39
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:53,640
But now it seems

40
00:01:54,239 --> 00:01:56,319
her ambition goes much further.

41
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,519
Does she intend

42
00:01:58,719 --> 00:02:01,840
to rule all five nations herself?

43
00:02:02,519 --> 00:02:03,359
Our first priority

44
00:02:03,359 --> 00:02:05,840
is to reclaim Bai Zhenhai's Tiger
Military Tally.

45
00:02:06,319 --> 00:02:07,439
Ha.

46
00:02:07,439 --> 00:02:08,759
Easier said than done.

47
00:02:09,280 --> 00:02:13,599
He'd fuse it to his bones if he could.

48
00:02:15,599 --> 00:02:18,919
He thinks the border is beyond my reach.

49
00:02:19,719 --> 00:02:21,960
Yet Longmen's seventy-two branches

50
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:25,439
have agents in every camp kitchen.

51
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,199
Longmen?

52
00:02:27,199 --> 00:02:28,080
The group

53
00:02:28,319 --> 00:02:29,520
that took just five years

54
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:32,719
to control the underground networks of
all five nations?

55
00:02:33,479 --> 00:02:35,280
Your Majesty has ties to Longmen?

56
00:02:35,719 --> 00:02:36,840
It's time

57
00:02:37,599 --> 00:02:39,159
Bai Zhenhai heard

58
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:45,039
what true defeat sounds like.

59
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:50,560
- Our lives are yours, Sire.
- Our lives are yours, Sire.

60
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:55,639
Your Majesty.

61
00:02:55,639 --> 00:02:57,319
Prince Rui requests an audience.

62
00:02:58,960 --> 00:03:01,039
Why can't that rascal stay in Shangyuan?

63
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:02,439
What's he up to now?

64
00:03:02,639 --> 00:03:03,960
Brother!

65
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:06,319
- We take our leave.
- We take our leave.

66
00:03:06,353 --> 00:03:06,953
Brother!

67
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:08,159
You've both worked hard.

68
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:13,199
Brother, save me!

69
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:13,639
What...

70
00:03:13,639 --> 00:03:15,400
Last time, you dressed as a woman.

71
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:17,319
What's the trick today?

72
00:03:17,319 --> 00:03:19,400
An epidemic has broken out in my fief!

73
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:19,919
Hey!

74
00:03:20,120 --> 00:03:21,000
Don't move!

75
00:03:21,039 --> 00:03:21,879
Stay there and talk.

76
00:03:24,719 --> 00:03:26,680
I'm burning up.

77
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:28,919
I'm dizzy and weak all over.

78
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:32,439
I'm about to depart this world!

79
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:35,159
You're far too young to talk of dying.

80
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:37,080
I haven't even married yet!

81
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:39,240
I haven't enjoyed all life has to offer!

82
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:39,919
These...

83
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:43,560
Scarlet rashes and pus-filled blisters.

84
00:03:43,639 --> 00:03:45,400
These are the signs of smallpox.

85
00:03:46,159 --> 00:03:46,960
What?

86
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:49,639
I'm doomed! It's all over!

87
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:50,879
I should have

88
00:03:50,879 --> 00:03:52,800
drunk my hundred-year-old Huadiao wine!

89
00:03:53,319 --> 00:03:55,560
Will I end up like the books say,

90
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:57,280
rotting away and dead in seven days?

91
00:03:58,479 --> 00:04:00,159
I...

92
00:04:00,479 --> 00:04:03,719
A Rhino Horn and Rehmannia Decoction may
ease the fever for now.

93
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:06,199
Don't lose hope, Your Highness.

94
00:04:06,199 --> 00:04:09,280
At least there are no black pustules.

95
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:10,520
You mean these?

96
00:04:12,319 --> 00:04:13,199
Stand back, Sire!

97
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:14,960
This form is highly contagious!

98
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:20,360
Do all you can to save him.

99
00:04:21,199 --> 00:04:22,240
Whatever happens,

100
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:23,560
I won't blame you.

101
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:25,519
Yes, Your Majesty.

102
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:27,199
Issue my command.

103
00:04:27,639 --> 00:04:28,639
Seal the palace at once.

104
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:31,000
No one is to breathe a word of this.

105
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:33,199
Anyone who leaves Shuxin Hall

106
00:04:33,959 --> 00:04:35,199
will be executed on the spot.

107
00:04:35,319 --> 00:04:36,120
Yes, Your Majesty.

108
00:04:39,160 --> 00:04:41,279
What am I going to do?

109
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:46,839
What am I going to do?

110
00:04:52,519 --> 00:04:54,600
My lady, please eat something.

111
00:04:54,959 --> 00:04:57,360
Being angry is no reason to starve.

112
00:05:00,839 --> 00:05:01,920
Looking at this

113
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:04,199
reminds me of the test field Consort Yao
destroyed.

114
00:05:05,079 --> 00:05:05,879
I'm not hungry.

115
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:08,480
Consort Yao grew up in luxury.

116
00:05:08,639 --> 00:05:10,240
She doesn't know how precious grain is.

117
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:12,920
She wastes it without a thought.

118
00:05:13,079 --> 00:05:15,439
Our lady grew up in luxury too!

119
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:17,399
She'd never do anything so vile.

120
00:05:17,519 --> 00:05:19,600
Consort Yao is just stupid and cruel.

121
00:05:23,279 --> 00:05:25,279
The more I let it slide, the more
wronged I feel.

122
00:05:25,439 --> 00:05:26,839
Giving in just makes me angrier.

123
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:30,399
I'm taking this to Ji Wujue.

124
00:05:30,759 --> 00:05:32,040
From now on,

125
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:34,839
Consort Yao won't set foot in my test
field again.

126
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:38,720
Don't follow me.

127
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:39,519
Eat your dinner.

128
00:05:39,720 --> 00:05:40,680
I can manage on my own.

129
00:05:41,879 --> 00:05:43,000
If he refuses,

130
00:05:43,160 --> 00:05:44,959
I'll camp out in Shuxin Hall.

131
00:05:45,839 --> 00:05:47,240
Let's see who gives in first.

132
00:05:47,879 --> 00:05:48,680
Hmph.

133
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:58,680
Hey!

134
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:01,120
Wait, Your Majesty.

135
00:06:01,399 --> 00:06:03,279
His Majesty is seeing no one.

136
00:06:05,839 --> 00:06:08,319
Has something happened to him?

137
00:06:09,519 --> 00:06:10,759
Of course not, Your Majesty.

138
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:12,800
He's perfectly well.

139
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:13,600
He's just...

140
00:06:14,279 --> 00:06:15,959
busy with affairs of state.

141
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:18,879
Ji Wujue!

142
00:06:18,879 --> 00:06:20,079
I know you're in there!

143
00:06:20,079 --> 00:06:20,879
Come out!

144
00:06:20,959 --> 00:06:21,759
Lu Yunluo.

145
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:23,920
Go back.

146
00:06:25,079 --> 00:06:26,000
I won't see you.

147
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:28,319
What's gotten into you?

148
00:06:28,759 --> 00:06:30,160
I'm not even angry yet!

149
00:06:30,279 --> 00:06:31,439
Why are you sulking?

150
00:06:31,519 --> 00:06:34,120
Please go back, Your Majesty.

151
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,240
It's cold at night.

152
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:37,160
You must take care of yourself.

153
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:37,800
Fine.

154
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:39,000
If you won't let me in,

155
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:39,399
I...

156
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,480
I'm staying right here.

157
00:06:44,160 --> 00:06:45,240
Your Majesty, please!

158
00:06:45,279 --> 00:06:46,560
The truth is, His Majesty...

159
00:06:47,319 --> 00:06:49,560
His Majesty has caught a chill.

160
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:51,240
He doesn't want you to catch it.

161
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:53,959
A chill?

162
00:06:53,959 --> 00:06:54,600
Well,

163
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:56,759
that's nothing serious.

164
00:06:56,759 --> 00:06:57,199
I...

165
00:06:57,199 --> 00:06:58,720
I know a little about medicine.

166
00:06:58,959 --> 00:07:00,040
Let me take a look at him.

167
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:01,560
The physician is with him.

168
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:03,279
My orders are to guard the entrance.

169
00:07:03,319 --> 00:07:04,720
I cannot let you in.

170
00:07:05,199 --> 00:07:06,000
Fine.

171
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:08,399
Bring me some food and drink.

172
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:12,519
Your Majesty, please!

173
00:07:12,519 --> 00:07:13,319
Actually...

174
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:14,279
Actually...

175
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:15,680
His Majesty...

176
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:18,600
It isn't just a chill.

177
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:22,560
It's a little more serious.

178
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:24,240
What?

179
00:07:26,439 --> 00:07:28,439
If the worst should happen,

180
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:31,120
the only person he'd worry about

181
00:07:31,120 --> 00:07:32,480
would be...

182
00:07:35,399 --> 00:07:36,800
It's the epidemic.

183
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:43,480
Be careful, Your Majesty!

184
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:48,199
He promised

185
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:51,319
he'd take me out of the palace.

186
00:07:54,519 --> 00:07:55,959
That unlucky fool.

187
00:07:59,639 --> 00:08:00,720
Ji Wujue!

188
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:03,079
Whatever you wish to say,

189
00:08:03,319 --> 00:08:04,920
I can pass it on.

190
00:08:05,439 --> 00:08:06,480
I'll tell him myself.

191
00:08:08,160 --> 00:08:08,959
Ji Wujue!

192
00:08:09,879 --> 00:08:11,839
Consort Yao destroyed my field!

193
00:08:11,839 --> 00:08:12,639
I'm here to complain!

194
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:13,759
Your Majesty!

195
00:08:13,759 --> 00:08:15,519
At a time like this,

196
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:18,079
can't you say something more tender?

197
00:08:19,519 --> 00:08:20,519
You won't come out?

198
00:08:20,519 --> 00:08:22,920
Then I'm not leaving!

199
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:25,240
Cao Zhongquan.

200
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:25,839
Yes?

201
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:26,920
Leave us.

202
00:08:27,360 --> 00:08:28,079
Yes, Sire.

203
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:30,720
Lu Yunluo.

204
00:08:31,959 --> 00:08:32,879
Whatever it is,

205
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:34,559
say it from there.

206
00:08:45,639 --> 00:08:46,440
Have...

207
00:08:47,799 --> 00:08:49,000
Have you eaten?

208
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:51,000
I...

209
00:08:52,799 --> 00:08:53,840
have no appetite.

210
00:08:54,519 --> 00:08:55,919
You still need to eat!

211
00:08:55,919 --> 00:08:57,159
You're ill, aren't you?

212
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:00,960
You know?

213
00:09:02,759 --> 00:09:03,759
Eunuch Cao

214
00:09:04,559 --> 00:09:06,279
said you'd caught a chill.

215
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,120
I'm fine.

216
00:09:14,799 --> 00:09:15,919
I'll recover in a few days.

217
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:18,919
Didn't you have a complaint?

218
00:09:19,639 --> 00:09:20,440
Tell me.

219
00:09:21,279 --> 00:09:23,240
I'll judge the matter for you.

220
00:09:29,919 --> 00:09:31,559
Consort Yao destroyed my wheat.

221
00:09:33,559 --> 00:09:34,919
But I saved some seeds.

222
00:09:35,759 --> 00:09:36,919
I'll just plant it again.

223
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:38,480
We can't let the people down.

224
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:39,200
And

225
00:09:39,559 --> 00:09:40,919
you mustn't worry too much.

226
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:42,480
Leave all that

227
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:45,360
to the Agriculture Office.

228
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:47,399
In three days,

229
00:09:50,639 --> 00:09:51,519
I will

230
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:54,519
send you out of the palace.

231
00:09:55,919 --> 00:09:57,480
No, I can't leave.

232
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,639
What if it goes wrong?

233
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:05,159
I mean with the wheat.

234
00:10:10,039 --> 00:10:11,559
Then stay a few days longer.

235
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:15,600
With Jia and Yi guarding you,

236
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:17,320
I can rest easy.

237
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:23,440
Lu Yunluo.

238
00:10:25,559 --> 00:10:27,159
Have you ever had a dream?

239
00:10:30,759 --> 00:10:31,759
To make money.

240
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:34,919
Lots and lots of money.

241
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:41,639
Besides making money?

242
00:10:46,519 --> 00:10:47,919
Nothing else.

243
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:52,840
How is that any different

244
00:10:54,399 --> 00:10:55,480
from being carefree?

245
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:01,759
What about you?

246
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:04,360
What's your dream?

247
00:11:05,879 --> 00:11:07,159
My dream?

248
00:11:09,559 --> 00:11:11,519
A world without war,

249
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:16,679
where no one goes hungry.

250
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:24,559
It'll come true.

251
00:11:27,039 --> 00:11:27,840
You've got this!

252
00:11:32,799 --> 00:11:33,840
Got what?

253
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:37,080
I mean,

254
00:11:40,639 --> 00:11:42,080
we can defy fate.

255
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:48,960
Things will turn around.

256
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:54,279
All right.

257
00:11:56,159 --> 00:11:57,000
I will...

258
00:12:05,519 --> 00:12:07,039
I'll do my best.

259
00:12:15,320 --> 00:12:16,120
Good.

260
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:25,480
Your Highness, terrible news!

261
00:12:25,519 --> 00:12:26,759
His Majesty has caught the disease!

262
00:12:26,759 --> 00:12:27,879
What?

263
00:12:50,680 --> 00:12:54,710
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

264
00:12:55,100 --> 00:12:59,320
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

265
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:03,540
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

266
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:07,790
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

267
00:13:08,130 --> 00:13:12,190
♪Cool dew, starry nights,
wheat sprouts in my hands♪

268
00:13:12,260 --> 00:13:16,440
♪I shape fields, not painted brows,
and fill them with hope♪

269
00:13:16,880 --> 00:13:20,250
♪Gold and silver bloom from the soil♪

270
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:25,400
♪I smile as the world storms on♪

271
00:13:27,060 --> 00:13:29,210
♪No finery to rival spring♪

272
00:13:29,390 --> 00:13:33,690
♪All I wish for are waves of green♪

273
00:13:36,100 --> 00:13:37,850
♪Where is beauty found?♪

274
00:13:38,030 --> 00:13:42,460
♪Just lift your eyes and see♪

275
00:13:43,020 --> 00:13:44,590
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

276
00:13:44,610 --> 00:13:47,080
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

277
00:13:47,150 --> 00:13:49,230
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

278
00:13:49,390 --> 00:13:51,160
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

279
00:13:51,770 --> 00:13:53,040
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

280
00:13:53,270 --> 00:13:55,670
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

281
00:13:55,910 --> 00:13:58,210
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

282
00:13:58,490 --> 00:14:02,810
♪Come, share a cup with me♪
